  "romaji": "fuka",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "addition; adding on",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "addition; adding on",
      "explanation": "Adding something extra to what already exists: a feature to a product, a condition to a contract, a tax to a price. Formal and written; best known from {付加価値|ふかかち} (added value)."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "32534_fuka_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{条件|じょうけん}→条件：03285_jouken⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{付加|ふか}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧。",
      "english": "They add a condition.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "32534_fuka_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{新|あたら}しい→新しい：00506_atarashii⟧⟦{機能|きのう}→機能：13165_kinou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{付加|ふか}⟦された→する：00392_suru⟧。",
      "english": "A new feature has been added.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "32534_fuka_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{商品|しょうひん}→商品：01436_shouhin⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦サービス→サービス：01531_saabisu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{付加|ふか}⟦して→する：00392_suru⟧、⟦{他社|たしゃ}→他社：17803_tasha⟧⟦と→と：00512_to⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{差|さ}→差：02771_sa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧つける。",
      "english": "They add services to the product to set it apart from competitors.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "32534_fuka_ex4",
      "japanese": "⟦{契約書|けいやくしょ}→契約書：06416_keiyakusho⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧、⟦{後|あと}→後：09580_ato⟧⟦から→から：00504_kara⟧⟦{特別|とくべつ}→特別：01120_tokubetsu⟧な⟦{条項|じょうこう}→条項：18974_joukou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{付加|ふか}⟦されていた→する：00392_suru⟧。",
      "english": "A special clause had been added to the contract afterwards.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Transitive. A formal written word; in speech ⟦{付|つ}け{加|くわ}える→付け加える：11520_tsukekuwaeru⟧ or ⟦{追加|ついか}する→追加する：19646_tsuikasuru⟧ is more usual. Mostly seen in compounds.\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{付加価値|ふかかち}→付加価値：11716_fukakachi⟧: added value\n- {付加|ふか}⟦{機能|きのう}→機能：13165_kinou⟧: additional function\n- {付加|ふか}⟦{税|ぜい}→税：03767_zei⟧: surtax; {付加価値税|ふかかちぜい}: value-added tax (VAT)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{追加|ついか}→追加：04060_tsuika⟧: addition — adding more of something, the everyday word\n- ⟦{付|つ}け{加|くわ}える→付け加える：11520_tsukekuwaeru⟧: to add (a remark, a detail)\n- ⟦{負荷|ふか}→負荷：14231_fuka⟧: load — a different word with the same reading",
